{"title":"Tomb Raider King","synopsis":"Makam Dewa mulai muncul di seluruh dunia. Karena peninggalan di dalam makam ini, banyak yang dapat menggunakan kekuatan legendaris ini untuk diri mereka sendiri, sementara yang lain diperbudak oleh para pengguna ini. Namun, Tomb Raider muncul dengan tujuan merampok relik tersebut. Raja Tomb Raider. \"Persetan! Apa bajingan itu sudah menjarah tempat ini juga ?! ” Apa yang Anda miliki adalah milik saya. Apa yang saya miliki pasti milik saya. Ini adalah kisah tentang Tomb Raider yang dihidupkan kembali yang akan melakukan apa pun yang dia bisa untuk mengklaim semua makam dan relik untuk dirinya sendiri!","alternative_title":"도굴왕","author":"SAN.G, Yuns","artist":"Redice Studio, 3B2S","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Romance","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"30a192e9-f0f5-4b40-a2d2-95360a602238","number":"411","title":"Chapter 411","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"f12ce4ae-7fcd-4f4b-bc49-2dc696960fc6","number":"410","title":"Chapter 410","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"e327c182-1a06-4d9c-b809-2f2524bf5071","number":"409","title":"Chapter 409","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"7bbaf304-17e6-478f-a7e1-0f32161eb2d3","number":"408","title":"Chapter 408","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"0c89126e-e3db-4e1c-a70e-9a5a7b6fbda5","number":"407","title":"Chapter 407","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"73fd6ff9-377a-40fb-9e9d-95c98078df09","number":"406","title":"Chapter 406","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"f599701c-208c-40e9-a556-74c70eb328e8","number":"405","title":"Chapter 405","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"613b25cb-5f54-446f-a7f6-e36cfc25846d","number":"404","title":"Chapter 404","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"c153a69a-5df9-4861-a20e-4deb065e5d32","number":"403","title":"Chapter 403","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"3406ace6-1c32-46ac-99f7-4a695ae73209","number":"402","title":"Chapter 402","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"4c86b02b-85d5-4ae0-9adf-7d536a4